# 换行符与二进制类型：让 Windows 上的 .bat 保持 CRLF（LF 的 .bat 在 cmd 里会解析出错，踩过）
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.txt text eol=crlf
*.cs text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
*.zip binary
*.ico -text
